## Highlights

<!-- Operator: populate from v0.1.1-MILESTONE-AUDIT.md "What shipped" section. Bullet format. -->

- **Recipes pivot (blueprint §7 refinement):** 4 composable primitives
  (MessageStream, DocumentCorpus, TemporalQuery, WorkingMemory) +
  10 thin vertical wrappers across Rust, Python, and TypeScript.
- **SDK bindings:** `pip install lunaris` and `npm install lunaris` — prebuilt
  wheels + native binaries across 5 platforms each, single-source codegen,
  CI parity gate prevents surface drift.
- **Helios production hardening:** HeliosScratchpad v2 over WorkingMemory;
  Consolidator-ON scoped to `helios:fs/%`; p50 tool-call latency ≤ 20 ms on
  both Moon and Postgres; SIGKILL chaos 50×2 zero orphans.
- **AuditEvent canonicalized:** enum lives in `lunaris-core::audit`; typed
  `publish_audit_event` helper; CI grep gate prevents inline envelope
  reintroduction.

