## Upgrade notes

<!-- Breaking changes, deprecations. -->

- `AuditEvent` re-exported from `lunaris-core::audit`; callers importing from
  `lunaris::audit` continue to work unchanged (Plan 13-01 preserved the
  public surface via a shim module).
- Downstream consumers parsing `__lunaris_audit__` envelopes: the byte-level
  JSON shape is unchanged for all 4 variants (Forget, VerifierArbitration,
  ConsolidatorPromotion, ConsolidatorArchive). Fixture-diff tests in
  `crates/lunaris-core/tests/audit_event_fixture_parity.rs` lock the v0.1.0
  wire format.

## Known limitations

- The other 15 HUMAN-UAT items from the v0.1.0 backlog remain deferred —
  see `milestones/v0.1.1-REQUIREMENTS.md` Out of Scope.
- Managed cloud (`api.lunaris.dev`) and system-wide Verifier / Consolidator
  ON remain v0.2 scope.

